# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values. Never commit the real .env file.
#
# Optional: enables LLM-synthesized answers in the AI Research Assistant.
# The app is fully functional without this set -- it falls back to showing
# raw, cited claims instead of a synthesized paragraph.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# To actually load this file into your shell environment, either:
#   export $(grep -v '^#' .env | xargs)   # bash/zsh, simple cases
# or use a tool like python-dotenv / direnv. BioSignal reads the key via
# os.environ directly (see biosignal/ai/client.py) -- it does not read
# .env files itself.
